{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 36","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/b/b2b8f8ac1c4169a8a032e3c80627d4a8928a551d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1, s_2, s_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"11\" /> be the respective sums of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/b/93b343956a16802014d023ded5828b5a319f0f37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n, 2n, 3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" /> terms of the same arithmetic progression with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as the first term and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> \nas the common difference. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/d/05d75144c34f7e6949e6a35e8a2330ef819e0bd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R=s_3-s_2-s_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is dependent on:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/8/6a8832b8345c878d8ec84864ca17d83f307d2ebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ a\\text{ }\\text{and}\\text{ }d\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ d\\text{ }\\text{and}\\text{ }n\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ a\\text{ }\\text{and}\\text{ }n\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ a, d,\\text{ }\\text{and}\\text{ }n\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{neither} \\text{ } a \\text{ } \\text{nor} \\text{ } d \\text{ } \\text{nor} \\text{ } n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"717\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The nth term of the sequence with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b476543dec7b60b4892931ec6644f1c664962b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + d(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />.  That means the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> terms is with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/b/acbab9da3cfafde97fd5c8d2786807a2584fc65e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(2a + dn -d)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"124\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>The 2nth term of the sequence with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/d/30dcef5d7df46160a3a58b9c06f7360361c5eb45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + d(2n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />.  That means the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93f5c51ea4b04b4992b003b39479f29018f6bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> terms is with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/5671468897f35a4479ac91b6a6e0b401c051f3b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2n(2a + 2dn -d)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"138\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>The 3nth term of the sequence with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddfaa6ee0fbc1470b5ec118871bed56d8c7b4df3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + d(3n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />.  That means the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45e3d817886b4d9dbd6bb74ad23463ed139ed68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" /> terms is with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/d/bbd37c86f87cd4dc21e776cfa3b73fa337ba77d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3n(2a + 3dn -d)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"138\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae90d71491f591ab5a16d19ee7629e8226ec9ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb6c5ddfd368673c178f3323ce2994cdbc8fbdab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/2062cc19e6689033aa8df1ac54aa2aef0a533fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> with its respective values results in\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/c/efc44dc4abd7f9076d5f0b1fc879e5fefbca6bfe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3n(2a + 3dn -d)}{2}-\\frac{2n(2a + 2dn -d)}{2}-\\frac{n(2a + dn -d)}{2}\\]\" width=\"443\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9ba022c3f75a6e4fdf83426410d4c74bf20849a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{6an + 9dn^2 -3nd}{2}-\\frac{4an + 4dn^2 - 2nd}{2}-\\frac{2an + dn^2 - dn}{2}\\]\" width=\"456\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f56c4c397e4556bddbfb966a3e23f2d11377fe7d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{4dn^2}{2}\\]\" width=\"37\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/6/ac687bbbf5f1b06096c0cc19a770f6b9821b9e06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2dn^2\\]\" width=\"35\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZdM2ou5Gsuw?t=89\">https://youtu.be/ZdM2ou5Gsuw?t=89</a>\n</p><p>MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external